# Cat Companion — Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** November 14, 2026
**Developer:** AxiomaraGames
**Contact:** axiomaragames@gmail.com

Cat Companion ("the app") is a cat care guide and companion: profiles of cat breeds, guides to care, nutrition, health, behavior, training, enrichment and adoption, a food and plant checker, a symptom checker, a breed scanner, a quiz, cat facts, and a care log for your own cats with care reminders and a weight log. This policy explains what information the app handles, and the credits and licences of the content and software it is built with.

## Summary

The app does not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal data. Everything you add to it stays on your device.

## Information the app stores on your device

To work, the app saves the following, **only on your device**:

- **My Cats:** the cats you add, with the name, breed, sex, neutered status and birthday you give them, and their weight log
- **Photos of your cats:** if you choose a photo for a cat, a resized copy is kept in the app's private storage on your device
- **Care reminders:** your reminders (such as grooming, flea treatment or vet checkups), how often they repeat and when you last did them
- **Favorites, checklist and quiz scores:** the breeds you save, the items you tick on the new cat checklist, and your best quiz scores
- **Settings:** your weight unit (kg or lb), notification settings, whether you have seen the welcome screen, and whether the full version is unlocked

This information is never sent to us or to anyone else. You can delete it at any time in Settings > Delete all my data, and it is deleted when you uninstall the app or clear its data in your device's settings.

**Photos:** the app only reads a photo when you choose one yourself in your device's photo picker, or take one for the breed scanner. The photo is never uploaded.

**Breed scanner:** when you scan a photo, a small image-recognition model built into the app looks at it on your device, without an internet connection. The photo is not sent anywhere. The last scanned photo is kept in the app's temporary storage until the next scan, and the app counts how many scans the free version has used.

**Notifications:** if you allow them, the app shows one daily notification listing the care reminders that are due. It is created on your device; no notification server is involved.

## Purchases

The app is free to download. The full version is a one-time in-app purchase made through Google Play. Google Play handles the payment under Google's own terms and privacy policy; we never see your payment details. The app only asks Google Play whether the full version has been bought on your Google account, so it can unlock it, also after a reinstall or on a new device.

## What the app does not do

- It does not ask you to create an account or sign in.
- It does not connect to our servers or any other server, apart from Google Play for the purchase described above. All breed profiles, guides and photos are built into the app.
- It does not collect analytics, crash reports, location, contacts or device identifiers.
- It does not show ads and contains no advertising or tracking software.
- It does not use your microphone, and it does not open the camera itself: for the breed scanner's "Take a photo" it asks your phone's own camera app for one photo, which you take there. The app needs no camera permission.

## Health information

The care, health and nutrition information in the app is general guidance for cat owners. It is not veterinary advice and does not replace a visit to a veterinarian. When your cat seems unwell, contact your vet. If your cat may have eaten something poisonous, contact your vet or a pet poison helpline right away.

## Children

The app is a general reference about cats and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children, because we collect no information at all.

## Changes to this policy

If this policy changes, the new version will be published at this address with a new effective date. Because the app collects no data, any change will not affect information you have already given us.

## Contact

Questions about this policy: axiomaragames@gmail.com

